---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout
  title="Jaanek Kerma — Game & Software Developer"
  description="Portfolio of Jaanek Kerma, a developer working with games and software."
>
  <section class="hero container" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Portfolio redesign in progress</div>
    <h1 id="hero-title">Hello, I'm <span class="gradient-text">Jaanek Kerma.</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-subtitle">Game developer & software programmer.</p>
    <p class="hero-copy">
      I'm rebuilding my portfolio to showcase the projects I've made,
      the systems I've developed, and the problems I've solved.
      For now, my existing portfolio remains available.
    </p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button button-primary" href="https://jaanekkerma.wixsite.com/portfolio" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View existing portfolio <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a class="button button-secondary" href="https://github.com/Ruscemp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="work-section" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="section-kicker">Project highlights</p>
          <h2 id="work-title">A foundation for what's next</h2>
        </div>
        <p>The final gallery and technical case studies will be added during the portfolio migration.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card-grid">
        <article class="work-card">
          <div class="card-number">01 / UNITY</div>
          <h3>Fortune's Gate</h3>
          <p>A solo Unity game project. Gameplay, technical breakdowns, and screenshots will be featured here.</p>
          <a href="https://github.com/Ruscemp/UnityGameJam2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View source repository <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="work-card">
          <div class="card-number">02 / PORTFOLIO</div>
          <h3>Previous projects</h3>
          <p>Game projects and programming work from the existing Wix portfolio will move into dedicated case studies.</p>
          <a href="https://jaanekkerma.wixsite.com/portfolio" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit current portfolio <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
